lines("§7Strip the bark with an axe.", "§7Logs and wooden slabs make an Ex Compressum", "§fAcacia Crucible§7, which melts leaves and", "§7saplings into water.", "§7Crafts into slabs, stairs, fences, doors,", "§7boats and signs; burns as fuel.", "§7Any planks make an Ex Nihilo §fWooden Barrel §7or", "§fSieve§7.", "§7Plant on dirt or grass to grow a acacia tree.", "§7Bone meal speeds up growth.", "§7Sieve §fDirt §7(any mesh) for an §fAcacia Seed§7, then", "§7plant it.", "§7Acacia log with bark on all sides. Crafts into", "§7planks; strip it with an axe.", "§7Powered rail: ejects riders, lights TNT", "§7minecarts and switches off hopper minecarts", "§7passing over it.", "§7Needs a redstone signal to activate.", "§7A purple flower used to craft magenta dye.", "§7Plant it on grass or dirt.", "§7Compact block of amethyst shards, purely", "§7Chimes when walked on or hit.", "§7Amethyst crystals that drop amethyst shards", "§7when mined.", "§7A Pickaxe drops more shards than other tools.", "§7Crystal for §fTinted Glass§7, spyglasses and", "§7calibrated sculk sensors.", "§7Rare Nether ore that smelts into netherite", "§7scrap.", "§7Needs a diamond Pickaxe.", "§7Gray stone: craft diorite with cobblestone, or", "§7four §fAndesite Pebble§7s.", "§7Nine of it compress into Compressed Andesite.", "§7Pottery sherd with an angler pattern. Four", "§7bricks or sherds in a diamond shape craft a", "§fDecorated Pot§7.", "§7Found by brushing suspicious sand or gravel at", "§7archaeology sites.", "§eRight-click §7to repair and combine items,", "§7rename them, or merge enchantments for", "§7experience levels.", "§7Wears down with use.", "§7Restores hunger; also the ingredient for", "§7Dropped by oak and dark oak leaves.", "§7Pottery sherd with an archer pattern. Four", "§7Six craft into wolf armor, and it repairs that", "§7armor. Dropped by armadillos.", "§7Holds a set of armor and displays it.", "§eRight-click §7with armor to equip it.", "§7Pottery sherd with an arms up pattern. Four", "§7Ammunition for bows, crossbows and dispensers.", "§7Craft it with flint, a stick and a feather.", "§7Carries a captured axolotl; place it in water", "§7to release it.", "§7Axolotls attack drowned and guardians.", "§7A small bush that grows into an azalea tree", "§7with bone meal.", "§7Plant it on dirt or moss.", "§7Azalea leaves decay away from logs, dropping", "§7azalea saplings and sticks. Shears keep them.", "§7A small white flower that crafts light gray", "§7Filling food made by smelting a potato in a", "§7furnace, smoker or campfire.", "§7Fast-growing plant that crafts scaffolding and", "§7sticks, and burns briefly as fuel.", "§7Plant it on dirt, grass or sand.", "§7Solid block of bamboo that crafts into bamboo", "§7planks. Strip it with an axe.", "§7A bamboo raft carrying a chest, to move items", "§7across water.", "§eRight-click §7water to place it.", "§7Decorative bamboo planks with a woven pattern.", "§7Crafted from bamboo slabs.", "§7A boat made of bamboo; §eRight-click §7water to", "§7place it and ride across.", "§7Stores 27 stacks like a chest, but opens even", "§7with a block on top. Crafted from planks and", "§7slabs.", "§7Not an Ex Nihilo Barrel, which brews and", "§7composts.", "§7Invisible creative-only block that stops", "§7movement. Only visible while you hold it.", "§7Dark Nether stone from basalt deltas. Smelts", "§7into smooth basalt.", "§7Beams light and gives nearby players effects", "§7when built on a pyramid of iron, gold, emerald", "§7or diamond blocks.", "§7Needs a nether star to craft.", "§7Unbreakable block at the bottom of the world.", "§7Only obtainable in creative mode.", "§7Home for bees that make honey.", "§7Needs Silk Touch to keep the bees inside when", "§7mined.", "§7Raw meat from cows. Cook it in a furnace,", "§7smoker or campfire to make steak.", "§7Crafted shelter for bees that fills with honey", "§7over time.", "§eRight-click §7a full hive with shears for", "§7honeycomb or a bottle for honey.", "§7Food that also crafts red dye and beetroot", "§7soup.", "§7Plant on farmland to grow beetroot.", "§7Sieve §fDirt §7with a Flint mesh or better.", "§7Hearty food made from six beetroots and a", "§7Rings when hit or powered and alerts villagers", "§7to raiders.", "§7Hang it from a block or place it on the", "§7ground.", "§7Plant with a leaf that tips down when stood", "§7on, a simple platform.", "§7Grows taller with bone meal.", "§7Makes four §fBirch Planks §7and burns as fuel.", "§fBirch Crucible§7, which melts leaves and", "§7Plant on dirt or grass to grow a birch tree.", "§7Sieve §fDirt §7(any mesh) for a §fBirch Seed§7, then", "§7Birch log with bark on all sides. Crafts into", "§7Decorative flag. Add patterns with a §fLoom §7and", "§7dyes.", "§7Copy a banner onto a §fShield §7in a crafting", "§eRight-click §7at night to sleep until morning.", "§7Sets your respawn point.", "§7Explodes if used in the Nether or the End.", "§7Carries a mix of items in one inventory slot,", "§7dyed black. §eRight-click §7to take items out.", "§7Craft a §fBundle §7with black dye.", "§7Place up to 4 on a block (or one on a cake),", "§7then light it with §fFlint and Steel§7.", "§7More candles give more light.", "§7Smooth, solid coloured building block.", "§7Made by letting §fConcrete Powder §7touch water.", "§7Falls like sand. Turns into §fConcrete §7when it", "§7touches water.", "§7Craft it from sand, gravel and a dye.", "§7Colours wool, glass, terracotta, sheep, beds,", "§7banners, signs and more.", "§7Patterned block: rotate the pieces to make", "§7bigger designs.", "§7Slime and honey blocks don't stick to it,", "§7which helps in piston machines.", "§7Black harness worn by a happy ghast so players", "§7can ride it. §eRight-click §7a happy ghast to", "§7equip.", "§7Crafted from three leather, two glass and", "§7black wool.", "§7Portable chest: 27 slots that keep their items", "§7when you break it.", "§7Can be carried in your inventory full of", "§7Coloured see-through glass. Tints beacon beams", "§7that pass through it.", "§7Hard coloured clay block. Dye §fTerracotta")
lines("§7(smelted clay) to colour it.", "§eSmelt §7it to get §fGlazed Terracotta§7.", "§7Soft colourful building block, also used for", "§7beds, banners and carpets.", "§7Shear sheep for it, or craft 4 §fString§7. Dye", "§7white wool any colour.", "§7Dark Nether stone; crafts into polished", "§7blackstone, bricks and more.", "§7Pottery sherd with a blade pattern. Four", "§7Smelts ores and metal gear twice as fast as a", "§7Can't cook food; use a smoker for that.", "§7Fuel for brewing stands; crafts eyes of ender", "§7and magma cream.", "§7Made by crafting a blaze rod.", "§7Sieve §fDust §7with an Iron mesh or better.", "§7Crafts into blaze powder and burns as", "§7long-lasting furnace fuel.", "§7Dropped by blazes.", "§7dyed blue. §eRight-click §7to take items out.", "§7Craft a §fBundle §7with blue dye.", "§7Thrown egg that can hatch a cold-variant", "§7Blue harness worn by a happy ghast so players", "§7Crafted from three leather, two glass and blue", "§7wool.", "§7Extremely slippery ice that never melts, great", "§7for boat roads.", "§7Made by compacting packed ice.", "§7A cyan flower that crafts light blue dye.", "§7Adds the bolt trim to armor at a §fSmithing", "§fTable§7.", "§7Found in trial chamber vaults.", "§7Duplicate with seven diamonds and one copper", "§7Crafts into bone meal and tames wolves when", "§7fed to them.", "§7Dropped by skeletons.", "§7Decorative block crafted from bone meal.", "§7Can be crafted back into bone meal.", "§7Fertilizer: §eRight-click §7crops, saplings and", "§7grass to grow them faster.", "§7Also made from bones.", "§7Sieve §fDust §7with a String mesh or better.", "§7Crafts bookshelves, enchanting tables and book", "§7and quills.", "§7Made from paper and leather.", "§7Place around an §fEnchanting Table §7to unlock", "§7stronger enchantments.", "§7Ranged weapon that fires arrows.", "§7Hold §eRight-click §7to draw, release to shoot.", "§7Holds soups and stews.", "§7Crafted from three planks.", "§7Live brain coral plant; dies if it isn't in or", "§7beside water.", "§7Needs Silk Touch to collect.", "§7Live brain coral block; turns dead without", "§7water nearby.", "§7Live brain coral fan; dies if it dries out.", "§7Food crafted from three wheat in a row.", "§7Crafts wind charges and the mace.", "§7Dropped by breezes in trial chambers.", "§7Pottery sherd with a brewer pattern. Four", "§7Brews potions from water bottles and", "§7ingredients, fueled by blaze powder.", "§7Needs a blaze rod to craft.", "§7Smelted from clay balls; used to craft bricks,", "§7flower pots and decorated pots.", "§7Classic red brick building block, crafted from", "§7four bricks.", "§7dyed brown. §eRight-click §7to take items out.", "§7Craft a §fBundle §7with brown dye.", "§7Thrown egg that can hatch a warm-variant", "§7Brown harness worn by a happy ghast so players", "§7brown wool.", "§7Small mushroom that grows in low light.", "§7Used in stews and fermented spider eyes.", "§7Huge mushroom block, dropping brown mushrooms", "§7Silk Touch keeps the block.", "§eRight-click §7suspicious sand or gravel to dust", "§7out buried items. Crafted from a feather,", "§7copper ingot and stick.", "§7Live bubble coral plant; dies if it isn't in", "§7or beside water.", "§7Live bubble coral block; turns dead without", "§7Live bubble coral fan; dies if it dries out.", "§7Carries water, lava, milk, powder snow or", "§7small mobs. §eRight-click §7a source block to", "§7scoop it.", "§7Made from iron ingots; this pack also accepts", "§7aluminum or lead ingots.", "§7Grows amethyst buds and clusters on its sides", "§7over time. Can't be crafted or pushed by", "§7pistons.", "§7Carries a mix of items in one inventory slot.", "§eRight-click §7to take items out or put them in.", "§7Pottery sherd with a burn pattern. Four bricks", "§7or sherds in a diamond shape craft a §fDecorated", "§fPot§7.", "§7Decorative bush that can be placed on grass or", "§7dirt.", "§7Hurts mobs that touch it. Grows on sand and", "§7smelts into green dye.", "§7Sieve §fSand §7(any mesh) for a §fCactus Seed§7, then", "§7Flower that blooms on top of a cactus. Crafts", "§7into pink dye.", "§7Placed block of seven slices; §eRight-click §7to", "§7eat one.", "§7Crafted from three milk buckets, two sugar, an", "§7egg and three wheat.", "§7Smooth white stone from amethyst geodes.", "§7Sculk sensor tuned to one vibration frequency;", "§7feed a redstone signal into its side to pick", "§7Crafted from a sculk sensor and amethyst", "§7shards.", "§7Cooks food slowly without fuel and works as a", "§7signal fire.", "§eRight-click §7with food to cook.", "§7Gives light when lit with flint and steel;", "§7stack up to four for more light.", "§7Dye it for color.", "§7Food you can plant on farmland, and a pig", "§7lure.", "§7Sieve §fDirt §7(any mesh) for a §fCarrot Seeds§7, then", "§eRight-click §7while riding a pig to speed it up.", "§7Crafted from a fishing rod and a carrot.", "§7Used to copy, zoom and lock maps.", "§7Wearable helmet that stops endermen angering", "§7Crafted with shears; also used to build", "§7golems.", "§7Holds water, lava or powder snow, and washes", "§7dye from armor and banners.", "§7Fill it with a bucket.", "§7Hangs lanterns and works as decoration.", "§7Crafted from iron ingots and nuggets.", "§7Creative-only command block that runs after", "§7the block pointing into it has run.", "§eRight-click §7to set its command.", "§7Chainmail armor for your feet slot.", "§7Can't be crafted; found from mobs and loot.", "§7Chainmail armor for your chest slot.", "§7Chainmail armor for your head slot.", "§7Chainmail armor for your legs slot.", "§7Furnace fuel and torch ingredient, made by", "§7smelting logs.", "§7Makes four §fCherry Planks §7and burns as fuel.", "§7Plant on dirt or grass to grow a cherry tree.", "§7Cherry log with bark on all sides. Crafts into", "§7Stores 27 stacks of items; two side by side", "§7form a large chest.", "§7Minecart that carries a chest's worth of", "§7Raw chicken: 30% chance of Hunger when eaten", "§7raw. Cook it first.")
lines("§7A worn anvil that works like a normal one but", "§7is closer to breaking.", "§7Holds up to six books and outputs a redstone", "§7signal for the last slot used.", "§eRight-click §7to add or take a book.", "§7Carved cinnabar for decoration. Crafted from", "§7two cinnabar slabs.", "§7Decorative copper block with a carved pattern.", "§7It weathers over time; wax it to stop that.", "§7Carved dark stone, a decorative building", "§7block. Crafted from cobbled deepslate slabs.", "§7Carved Nether bricks for decoration.", "§7Carved dark Nether stone for decoration.", "§7Carved quartz block for decorating. Crafted", "§7from two quartz slabs.", "§7Carved red sandstone for decoration.", "§7Carved resin bricks for decoration. Crafted", "§7from two resin brick slabs.", "§7Carved sandstone for decoration.", "§7Carved stone bricks. Eight of them around an", "§7iron ingot make a §fLodestone§7.", "§7Carved sulfur for decoration. Crafted from two", "§7sulfur slabs.", "§7Carved tuff block for decoration.", "§7Carved tuff bricks for decoration.", "§7Grows on chorus plants in the End.", "§7Planted on end stone, it grows into a chorus", "§7Sieve §fCrushed End Stone §7with a String mesh or", "§7better.", "§7Edible fruit that teleports you a short way", "§7when eaten.", "§7Smelts into popped chorus fruit.", "§7The stem of a chorus tree in the End.", "§7Red stone block from the backported Sulfur", "§7Caves; polishes into cinnabar bricks, slabs,", "§7stairs and walls.", "§7Brick-pattern cinnabar. Crafted from four", "§7polished cinnabar; also cuts into slabs,", "§7Soft block that gives four clay balls when", "§7Barrel: soak Ex Nihilo dust in a Barrel of", "§7water.", "§7Smelts into a brick and crafts into clay", "§7Shows the time of day.", "§7Crafted from gold ingots and redstone.", "§7Pale Garden flower that opens at night. Crafts", "§7into gray dye.", "§7Furnace fuel and torch ingredient.", "§7Sieve §fGravel §7with a Flint mesh or better.", "§7Compact block of nine coal, a long-burning", "§7furnace fuel.", "§7Ore that drops coal when mined.", "§7Any Pickaxe works.", "§7Dirt that doesn't grow grass; till it with a", "§7hoe for plain dirt.", "§7Craft from dirt and gravel.", "§7Adds the coast trim to armor at a §fSmithing", "§7Found in shipwreck chests.", "§7Duplicate with seven diamonds and one", "§7cobblestone.", "§7Deepslate dropped when mined; crafts into", "§7polished deepslate and bricks.", "§7Basic stone for tools and furnaces; smelts", "§7into stone.", "§7Four stone pebbles craft it; hammer it into", "§7gravel.", "§7Slows anything that walks into it.", "§7Cut it with a sword or shears.", "§7Plant on jungle logs to grow cocoa; used for", "§7cookies and brown dye.", "§7Raw fish; cook it in a furnace, smoker or", "§7campfire first.", "§7Carries a captured cod; place it in water to", "§7Creative-only block that runs commands when", "§7powered. §eRight-click §7to set its command.", "§7Creative-only minecart that runs a command", "§7repeatedly while it rides rails.", "§7Redstone part that compares signals and reads", "§7container contents.", "§7Points to the world spawn point.", "§7Crafted from iron ingots and redstone.", "§7Turns plant items into bone meal.", "§eRight-click §7with food and plants; take the", "§7bone meal when full.", "§7Gives underwater breathing and mining speed", "§7when built inside a frame of prismarine", "§7Crafted from a heart of the sea and nautilus", "§7shells.", "§7Steak: filling meat food cooked from raw beef.", "§7Meat food cooked from raw chicken.", "§7Fish food cooked from raw cod.", "§7Meat food cooked from raw mutton.", "§7Filling meat food cooked from a raw porkchop.", "§7Meat food cooked from raw rabbit.", "§7Fish food cooked from raw salmon.", "§7Quick snack made from wheat and cocoa beans.", "§7Compact copper that slowly weathers through", "§7four stages.", "§7Wax it to stop the aging.", "§7Light that toggles on and off with each new", "§7Decorative copper grate that lets water and", "§7light through; it weathers over time.", "§7Crafting metal used for copper blocks,", "§7spyglasses and lightning rods.", "§7Ore that smelts into copper ingots. Ex Nihilo", "§fCopper Ore Chunk§7s smelt straight into ingots.", "§7A blue flower that crafts blue dye.", "§7Cracked deepslate bricks for a weathered look.", "§7Smelt the plain bricks to get it.", "§7Cracked deepslate tiles for a weathered look.", "§7Cracked nether bricks for a weathered look.", "§7Cracked polished blackstone bricks for a", "§7weathered look.", "§7Cracked stone bricks for a weathered look.", "§7Smelt plain stone bricks to get it.", "§7Redstone-powered auto-crafter: set a pattern", "§7in its slots and feed it items.", "§7Fire it with a redstone signal.", "§eRight-click §7for a 3x3 crafting grid.", "§7Core of a creaking tree in the Pale Garden.", "§7Crafted from a resin block between two pale", "§7oak logs.", "§7Gives a banner the creeper design at a §fLoom§7.", "§7Crafted from paper and a creeper head.", "§7Mob head to wear or place. Dropped by creepers", "§7killed by a charged creeper.", "§7Nether plant that grows into a huge crimson", "§7fungus with bone meal.", "§7Plant it on crimson nylium.", "§7Crimson stem with bark on all sides. Crafts", "§7into planks; strip it with an axe.", "§7Nether surface block that lets fungi grow and", "§7spreads over netherrack.", "§7Nether planks that do not burn. Craft slabs,", "§7stairs, fences, doors and signs.", "§7Small Nether plant that grows on crimson", "§7nylium.", "§7Nether tree trunk that does not burn. Makes", "§7four §fCrimson Planks§7; strip it with an axe.", "§7Ranged weapon that holds a loaded arrow or", "§7firework rocket.", "§7Hold §eRight-click §7to load, click again to", "§7shoot.", "§7Obsidian that drips purple particles; used to", "§7craft respawn anchors.", "§7Decorative copper block with stairs and slabs;", "§7it weathers over time.", "§7Decorative block: four red sandstone, or one", "§7in a stonecutter.", "§7Decorative block: four sandstone, or one in a", "§7dyed cyan. §eRight-click §7to take items out.")
lines("§7Craft a §fBundle §7with cyan dye.", "§7Cyan harness worn by a happy ghast so players", "§7Crafted from three leather, two glass and cyan", "§7Anvil two steps from breaking; each use has a", "§7chance to damage it further.", "§7A yellow flower that crafts yellow dye.", "§7Pottery sherd with a danger pattern. Four", "§7Decay away from logs, dropping saplings,", "§7sticks and apples. Break with shears to keep", "§7Makes four §fDark Oak Planks §7and burns as fuel.", "§fDark Oak Crucible§7, which melts leaves and", "§7Needs four saplings in a 2x2 square to grow a", "§7dark oak tree. Bone meal speeds it up.", "§7Sieve §fDirt §7(any mesh) for a §fDark Oak Seed§7,", "§7then plant it.", "§7Dark Oak log with bark on all sides. Crafts", "§7Deep green block found at ocean monuments.", "§7Crafted from eight prismarine shards and an", "§7ink sac.", "§7Outputs redstone power based on sunlight.", "§eRight-click §7to switch it to night detection.", "§7Dried-out brain coral, a decorative block.", "§7A coral block that dried out away from water;", "§7decorative only.", "§7Dried-out brain coral fan, for decoration.", "§7Dried-out bubble coral, a decorative block.", "§7Dried-out bubble coral fan, for decoration.", "§7Dry plant that drops sticks.", "§7Dried-out fire coral, a decorative block.", "§7Dried-out fire coral fan, for decoration.", "§7Dried-out horn coral, a decorative block.", "§7Dried-out horn coral fan, for decoration.", "§7Dried-out tube coral, a decorative block.", "§7Dried-out tube coral fan, for decoration.", "§7Creative-only tool that cycles a block's", "§7states. §eRight-click §7a block to change it.", "§7Stores one stack of items.", "§7Decorated with pottery sherds on its sides.", "§7Hard dark stone found deep underground; mining", "§7it gives cobbled deepslate.", "§7Decorative block: four polished deepslate, or", "§7a stonecutter.", "§7Deepslate version of Coal Ore; mined the same", "§7way, but tougher.", "§7Found deep underground.", "§7Deepslate version of Copper Ore; mined the", "§7same way, but tougher.", "§7Deepslate version of Diamond Ore; mined the", "§7Deepslate version of Emerald Ore; mined the", "§7Deepslate version of Gold Ore; mined the same", "§7Deepslate version of Iron Ore; mined the same", "§7Deepslate version of Lapis Lazuli Ore; mined", "§7the same way, but tougher.", "§7Deepslate version of Redstone Ore; mined the", "§7Decorative block: four deepslate bricks, or a", "§7Rail that outputs a redstone signal when a", "§7minecart passes over it.", "§7Gem for diamond tools and armor, enchanting", "§7tables and jukeboxes.", "§7Sieve §fGravel §7with an Iron mesh or better.", "§7Diamond axe that chops wood quickly.", "§7Made from diamonds and sticks. Repair it at an", "§7Compact block of nine diamonds.", "§7Diamond armor for your feet slot.", "§7Made from diamonds. Wear the full set for the", "§7most protection.", "§7Diamond armor for your chest slot.", "§7Diamond armor for your head slot.", "§7Diamond hoe that tills farmland.", "§7Diamond armor for horses. §eRight-click §7a tamed", "§7horse to equip it.", "§7Not craftable; found in dungeon, temple and", "§7stronghold chests.", "§7Diamond armor for your legs.", "§7Ore that drops diamond when mined.", "§7Needs an iron Pickaxe or better.", "§7Diamond pickaxe that mines stone and ores.", "§7Diamond shovel that digs dirt, sand and", "§7Diamond sword, a melee weapon.", "§7Speckled white stone. Craft it from four Ex", "§7Nihilo diorite pebbles.", "§7Common soil that grows crops and saplings.", "§7Nine compressed dirt blocks break back into", "§7Walkable path block made by using a shovel on", "§7grass.", "§7Farm animals won't trample it.", "§7Part of a music disc; combine nine to craft", "§7Disc 5.", "§7Found in ancient cities.", "§7Shoots items out when powered, or places", "§7things like buckets and armor.", "§7Collected from the Ender Dragon's cloud with a", "§7glass bottle.", "§7Used to make lingering potions.", "§7Rare block that teleports when clicked.", "§7Dropped when the Ender Dragon is first slain.", "§7This pack also crafts it: end crystals,", "§7shulker shells, a nether star, dragon breath", "§7and a Dragon Heart.", "§7Mob head to wear or display; its jaw moves", "§7when powered by redstone.", "§7Dried block that rehydrates in water over time", "§7and hatches a baby happy ghast.", "§7Crafted from eight ghast tears around soul", "§7sand.", "§7Cheap, fast-to-eat food smelted from kelp.", "§7Compact fuel block made from nine dried kelp.", "§7Cave block that pointed dripstone grows from.", "§7Mine it with a Pickaxe.", "§7Drops items out when powered; unlike a", "§7dispenser it just ejects them.", "§7Adds the dune trim to armor at a §fSmithing", "§7Found in desert pyramid chests.", "§7Eight around a compass craft a recovery", "§7compass. Found in ancient city chests.", "§7Throw it with §eRight-click §7for a small chance", "§7of a chick.", "§7Used in cake and pumpkin pie.", "§7Wings that let you glide.", "§7Wear in the chestplate slot, jump, and hold", "§7jump again to glide.", "§7Villager currency; trade it for items.", "§7Also used for beacons.", "§7Sieve §fGravel §7with a Diamond mesh or better.", "§7Compact block of nine emeralds.", "§7Ore that drops emerald.", "§7Holds enchantments to apply with an anvil to a", "§7matching item.", "§7Strong food: Absorption, Regeneration,", "§7Resistance and Fire Resistance.", "§7This pack crafts it from eight gold blocks", "§7around an apple.", "§7Spends lapis lazuli and levels to enchant", "§7Surround it with bookshelves for better", "§7options.", "§7Heals the Ender Dragon and explodes when hit.", "§7Place on obsidian or bedrock.", "§7Part of the stronghold portal.", "§7Fill every frame with an eye of ender to open", "§7the way to the End.", "§7Light source that stacks end to end.", "§7Pale stone from the End.", "§7Barrel: add glowstone dust to a Barrel of", "§7Decorative block: four end stone, or a", "§7Chest whose storage is shared by all your", "§7Ender Chests.", "§7Needs Silk Touch to pick up.", "§7Throw it with §eRight-click §7to find strongholds", "§7and fill End portal frames.", "§7Throw it with §eRight-click §7to teleport where it")
